[38;2;124;124;124mand $i(p) = \text{number of steps}$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mTherefore $d(p) \leq 2 \cdot i(p)$, which gives $i(p) \geq d(p)/2$. That's a [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mlower bound on $i$, not an upper bound![0m

